      "content": "<h3>Your first ArrayList program</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>add(x)</code> puts x at the <strong>end</strong>; <code>get(i)</code> reads the element at index i; <code>size()</code> tells how many elements there are.</li>\n<li>Printing the list shows all elements in <code>[a, b, c]</code> form because <code>ArrayList</code> overrides <code>toString()</code>.</li>\n<li>The last valid index is always <code>size() - 1</code>. Reading beyond it throws <code>IndexOutOfBoundsException</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
